  "cmd_name": "scale-cluster-node-pool",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Scales out a node pool to ensure that the number of nodes is sufficient to support your workloads. The Count parameter must be greater than the current number of nodes in the node pool. If the node pool contains nodes that failed to scale out, you must call the DeleteClusterNodes operation to delete the failed nodes before you scale out the node pool. A scale-out task typically takes 5 to 10 minutes. If the task takes more than 1 hour, the scale-out fails. In this case, contact technical support",
  "description_zh": "您可以调用ScaleClusterNodePool对节点进行扩容，以保证节点数量足够支撑业务运行。\ncount 参数必需大于当前节点池的节点数。如果节点池中存在扩容失败的 node（failed node），则必需使用 DeleteClusterNodes 接口删除对应 node 后进行扩容。\n节点扩容正常耗时在5-10分钟内，超过1小时为扩容失败，请联系技术支持",
